        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma mvuga ibi, nkabishingira intahe mu Mwami wacu, ngo ntimube mukigenda nk’ukw abanyamahanga bagenda, bagendera mu bitagira ikimazi vyo mu bgenge bgabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.17",
